              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "glibc: glibc: Invalid DNS hostname returned via gethostbyaddr functions"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Calling gethostbyaddr or gethostbyaddr_r with a configured nsswitch.conf that specifies the library's DNS backend in the GNU C library version 2.34 to version 2.43 could result in an invalid DNS hostname being returned to the caller in violation of the DNS specification."
